<TUV xml:lang='it'>MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide MainHandlers and select type for All Protocol Services of Diagnostic class.</TUV>
