<ENUMDEF id='_00000251ADFCA8D0' oid='FE844E05373148f0B366AD803FC51228' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PostHandlerSupport (for all Protocol Services)</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>PostHandlerSupport (for all Protocol Services)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide type of Service Post Handlers for All Protocol Services of Diagnostic class.
Restriction: Only evaluated if 'MainHandlerSupport' (on ProtocolService Level)' is set, i.e. unequal to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide type of Service Post Handlers for All Protocol Services of Diagnostic class.
