<ENUMDEF id='_00000251D40D7840' oid='ED05A33409B94a6fA2064CFD1A60CD67' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>MainHandlerSupport (on Service Level)</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>MainHandlerSupport (on Service Level)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide MainHandler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination).
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide MainHandler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination).
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>MainHandlerSupport</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>user</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>user</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>oem</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>oem</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='2'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>generated</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>generato</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMDEF>
<ENUMDEF id='_00000251D40D7500' oid='D69BD26CFFE5493fA9550415106E8E67' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PreHandlerSupport</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>PreHandlerSupport</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide type of Service Pre Handler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination). The Service Pre Handler is executed directly before the Main Handler.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide type of Service Pre Handler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination). The Service Pre Handler is executed directly before the Main Handler.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>PreHandlerSupport</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>none</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>none</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>oem</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>oem</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='2'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>user</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>user</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMDEF>
<STRDEF id='_00000251B1346000' oid='09324F635B8845fd89B7F8AA04CA9BC8' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PreHandlerOverrideName</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>PreHandlerOverrideName</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide alternative name for Service Pre Handler instead of generated one (default prefix + PreHandlerOverrideName). You can reuse a Service Pre Handler for different Services, if you specify the same Override Name.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide alternative name for Service Pre Handler instead of generated one (default prefix + PreHandlerOverrideName). You can reuse a Service Pre Handler for different Services, if you specify the same Override Name.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>PreHandlerOverrideName</QUAL>
<STRING>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'></TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'></TUV>
</STRING>
</STRDEF>
<ENUMDEF id='_00000251D40D6180' oid='1C2D0A5A0796487e8A8A8E9198668A65' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PostHandlerSupport</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>PostHandlerSupport</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide type of Service Post Handler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination. The Service Post Handler is executed after a positive confirmation of the positive response.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide type of Service Post Handler for current Service (Service/Subfunction combination. The Service Post Handler is executed after a positive confirmation of the positive response.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i.e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>PostHandlerSupport</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>none</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>none</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>oem</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>oem</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='2'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>user</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>user</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMDEF>
<STRDEF id='_00000251B13461D0' oid='A2957980E88B424aBEE3A2A79FA18E1A' attrcatref='_00000251CEA3E790'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PostHandlerOverrideName</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>PostHandlerOverrideName</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide alternative name for Service Post Handler instead of generated one (default prefix + PostHandlerOverrideName).You can reuse a Service Post Handler for different Services, if you specify the same Override Name.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i. e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Provide alternative name for Service Post Handler instead of generated one (default prefix + PostHandlerOverrideName).You can reuse a Service Post Handler for different Services, if you specify the same Override Name.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'MainHandlerSupport (on Protocol Service Level)' is not set, i. e. equals to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>PostHandlerOverrideName</QUAL>
<STRING>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'></TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'></TUV>
</STRING>
</STRDEF>
