<FC b='1'>referenced </FC>
<FC>and </FC>
<FC b='1'>not copied</FC>
<FC>.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>The document specify Fiat requirements for the diagnosis implementation on the above mentioned ECU. </FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>The document specify Fiat requirements for the diagnosis implementation on the above mentioned ECU. The communication protocol is compliant to the Norma </FC>
<FC b='1' u='1'>FIAT 07209  ed. 7</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>The diagnostic requirements are compliant to the FGA norms </FC>
<FC b='1' u='1'>09009 ed. 3A and 09009/02 "TFO 07209 and 09009 Diagnostic Requirements Addendum for Next Gen EE Architecture without AUTOSAR".</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
