<TUV xml:lang='it'>Statuts Lamps</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>Output Status Lamps:</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>This parameter describes the status driven for the lamps.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>Value ON (0x01) means status lamp switched on or blinking</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>Value OFF (0x00) means status lamp switched off or not implemented in PROXI configuration (refer to finalized PROXI requirements documentation)</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' struct='1'><PARA><FC>Output Status Lamps:
This parameter describes the status driven for the lamps.
Value ON (0x01) means status lamp switched on or blinking
Value OFF (0x00) means status lamp switched off or not implemented in PROXI configuration (refer to finalized PROXI requirements documentation)</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Statuts_Lamps</QUAL>
