<SIMPLECOMPCONT oid='6F2CA5B011114a508184F6E1007F3735' shproxyref='_00000251D4599FD0'>
<STRUCT oid='D604B692708A4c67BDF9F72E7B3948B7' spec='no' dtref='_00000251D42C7860'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Last Service date</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Last Service date</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Last service date 
This is the date of the last service and is 

composed by :
Year 1, Year 2, Year 3, Year 4, Month 1, Month 2, Day 1, Day 2

Example:
October 3, 2009 --&#62;Year1= 2; Year2=0; Year3=0; Year4=9; Month1=1, Month2=0, Day1=0, Day2= 3</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Last service date 
This is the date of the last service and is 

composed by :
Year 1, Year 2, Year 3, Year 4, Month 1, Month 2, Day 1, Day 2

Example:
October 3, 2009 --&#62;Year1= 2; Year2=0; Year3=0; Year4=9; Month1=1, Month2=0, Day1=0, Day2= 3</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Last_Service_date</QUAL>
