<DIAGINST id='_00000251D48A5C90' oid='E220B1271E3A426fAF59D334117DC7F4' tmplref='_00000251D421BFF0' req='notReq'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Vehicle speed limit for Plant Mode activation</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Vehicle speed limit for Plant Mode activation</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC fs='200'>This parameter is used to define the max vehicle speed beyond which the enabling or modification of the "Plant Mode Status" is not allowed.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>If the vehicle speed exceeds the limit set in RDI $3FFD “Vehicle speed limit for Plant Mode activation”, it shall not be possible to enable or modify the Plant Mode.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>Each Plant will be able to write this DID and set a max vehicle speed value (zz) different from default value (zz &#60;= 10km/h).</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' struct='1'><PARA><FC fs='200'>This parameter is used to define the max vehicle speed beyond which the enabling or modification of the "Plant Mode Status" is not allowed.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>If the vehicle speed exceeds the limit set in RDI $3FFD “Vehicle speed limit for Plant Mode activation”, it shall not be possible to enable or modify the Plant Mode.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>Each Plant will be able to write this DID and set a max vehicle speed value (zz) different from default value (zz &#60;= 10km/h).</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Vehicle_speed_limit_for_Plant_Mode_activation</QUAL>
