<DIAGINST id='_00000251D48A2090' oid='0394A1F713CB45e0BD8100E59ECE2AFE' tmplref='_00000251D421BFF0' req='notReq'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Plant Mode odometer locking value</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Plant Mode odometer locking value</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC fs='200'>This parameter is used to define the max distance accesible beyond which the enabling of the "Plant Mode" is not allowed.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>If Total Odometer value is equal or higher than the value set in RDI $3FFE “Plant Mode odometer locking value”, it shall not be possible to enable the Plant Mode.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>Each Plant will be able to write this DID and set a odometer value (zz) to lock the Plant Mode, different from default value (zz &#60;= 200km</FC>
<FC tcol='0' fs='200'>) </FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' struct='1'><PARA><FC fs='200'>This parameter is used to define the max distance accesible beyond which the enabling of the "Plant Mode" is not allowed.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>If Total Odometer value is equal or higher than the value set in RDI $3FFE “Plant Mode odometer locking value”, it shall not be possible to enable the Plant Mode.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='200'>Each Plant will be able to write this DID and set a odometer value (zz) to lock the Plant Mode, different from default value (zz &#60;= 200km</FC>
<FC tcol='0' fs='200'>) </FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Plant_Mode_odometer_locking_value</QUAL>
