<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>IdentificationCode</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>IdentificationCode</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>With this request the ECU must reply with following RDI :</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F187 : vehicleManufacturerSparePartNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F190 : VIN</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F192 : systemSupplierECUHardwareNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F193 : systemSupplierECUHardwareVersionNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F194 : systemSupplierECUSoftwareNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F195 : systemSupplierECUSoftwareVersionNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F196 : exhaustRegulationOrTypeApprovalNumber</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>$F1A5 : ISO Code</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' struct='1'><PARA><FC>With this request the ECU must reply with following RDI :
$F187 : vehicleManufacturerSparePartNumber
$F190 : VIN
$F192 : systemSupplierECUHardwareNumber
$F193 : systemSupplierECUHardwareVersionNumber
$F194 : systemSupplierECUSoftwareNumber
$F195 : systemSupplierECUSoftwareVersionNumber
$F196 : exhaustRegulationOrTypeApprovalNumber
$F1A5 : ISO Code
</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>IdentificationCode</QUAL>
