<RECORD id='_00000251D46AE4D0' oid='5F72CE993DD54fb68421F2D37024CA8E' v='10027009'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Secure warning Lamps - General Electrical Failure</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****

***** Customer Perception Symptom*****

***** Possible Causes*****
one or more of the following lamps are defective:

 Hand brake / low brake fluid level / EBD failure (EMEA market)
 Hand brake / low brake fluid level / EBD failure (NAFTA market)
 ABS system failure
 ESC system intervention/failure
 ESC OFF
 Power steering failure
 AIR-BAG system failure
 Passenger Airbag deactivation
 Seat Belt Reminder (SBR)



***** Repair Action*****
Sostitution IPC
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_EO;I_ACC
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
After reset and at every key-on, the The Lamps Short circuit and open circuit are checked. If  such check fails, the DTC will be created.
6 &#60; Vbatt &#60; 17 [Volt]
LED ON ( only for Leds)
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****

***** Maturation Time*****
0,2 to 1,5 (with fault present)
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_EO;I_ACC
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
KEY 0N
10 &#60; Vbatt &#60; 16 [Volt]
LED ON ( only for Leds)
No CA or CC on Leds
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****

***** De-Maturation Time*****
1
</TUV>
