8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT DETECTION CONDITIONS:
Error detected if: 
IF
IPC recognizes a button pressed for longer than Tpl (BH-CAN signal assumes the "Pressed" value for longer than Tpl)
THEN
IPC shall:
 1) set a DTC *
 2)  internally consider the switch as NOT PRESSED
***** Maturation Time*****
20s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_OFF;I_ON;I_ST;I_EO
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT HEALING CONDITIONS:
Error is healed if: 
the BH-CAN signal assumes again the "Not pressed" value  (button stuck condition cleared) ***

*** In that case IPC shall clear the Stuck Button DTC
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
