CAN Controller detected an Bus Off status.
NOTE: This diagnosis Inhibits NODE MUTE, ABSENT and FAULTY diagnosis.
***** Maturation Time*****
1000 ms
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
