<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DigSpeedometerKm.Info - Signal plausibility failure</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****
VF562
Id 15

***** Customer Perception Symptom*****
unknow information display info
***** Possible Causes*****
CAN NODE 30 (HALF) is Absent
***** Repair Action*****
verify node HALF
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_OFF;I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO;I_P_OFF
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT DETECTION CONDITIONS:
Error detected if: 
if "CAN node 30 (HALF)" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "Traffic_Sign_Recognition" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "NAV_Presence" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "STATUS_TSR.TSRSts" signal is equal to "Not_Active" value , then "IPC" shall:   
not enable the plausibility diagnosis of the "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" internal signal.

otherwise

if "CAN node 30 (HALF)" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "Traffic_Sign_Recognition" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "STATUS_TSR.TSRSts" signal is equal to "Not_Active" value , then "IPC" shall:   
not enable the plausibility diagnosis of the "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" internal signal.
***** Maturation Time*****
1s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT HEALING CONDITIONS:
Error is healed if:
If "CAN Node 30 (HaLF)" parameter is equal to "Present" value AND "Traffic_Sign_Recognition" parameter is equal to "Present" value AND "NAV_Presence" parameter is equal to "Present" value AND "STATUS_TSR.TSRSts" signal is equal to "Active" value AND "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" is equal to "Not_Valid", then "IPC" shall:
consider "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" to the previous value until IPC receives a valid value different from "Not_Valid"

otherwise

If "CAN Node 30 (HaLF)" parameter is equal to "Present" value AND "Traffic_Sign_Recognition" parameter is equal to "Present" value AND "STATUS_TSR.TSRSts" signal is equal to "Active" value AND "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" is equal to "Not_Valid", then "IPC" shall:
consider "DigSpeedometerKm.Info" to the previous value until IPC receives a valid value different from "Not_Valid"
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
</RECORD>
