</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****
VF439 id 9
***** Customer Perception Symptom*****
unknow information display info
***** Possible Causes*****
If "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter  is equal to "Terrain Selector" value
If "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter is equal to "Drive Selector" value AND "BODY2.DriveStyleSts" signal is equal to "SNA" value for a time greater or equal to "MissingMsg_Default_Time"
***** Repair Action*****
verify node
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_OFF;I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO;I_P_OFF
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
If "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter is equal to "Absent" value OR "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter  is equal to "Terrain Selector" value, then IPC shall:   
? not enable the diagnosis of the "plausibility" on "BODY2.DriveStyleSts" message.

If "Drive_Style_Selector" parameter is equal to "Drive Selector" value AND "BODY2.DriveStyleSts" signal is equal to "SNA" value for a time greater or equal to "MissingMsg_Default_Time" parameter, then "IPC" shall:
? set a "DTC" to "Present" according to "IPC Diagnostic Requirement" document,
? mantain last valid value received
***** Maturation Time*****
1s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
