I_OFF;I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO;I_P_OFF
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
If "BODY2.DriveStyleSts" signal is different from "SNA" value, then "IPC" shall:
? heal the "DTC", according to "IPC Diagnostic Requirement" document,
? the functionality shall be immediatly recovered
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
