<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****
VF559 ID 33
***** Customer Perception Symptom*****
BSD fail
***** Possible Causes*****
If IPC_OperationalModeSts.Info is equal to "Ignition_On" or to "Ignition_On_Engine_On":
if IPC receives STATUS_UBSS_BH.Ubss_Sts equal to "SNA"  for a time greater than a calibrated threshold DTC_Time_SNA period
***** Repair Action*****
verify node BSD
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
If IPC_OperationalModeSts.Info is equal to "Ignition_On" or to "Ignition_On_Engine_On":
if IPC receives STATUS_UBSS_BH.Ubss_Sts equal to "SNA"  for a time greater than a calibrated threshold DTC_Time_SNA period, then IPC shall:
? set related DTC according to "IPC Diagnostic Specification";
? store a DTC as detailed in the "IPC Diagnostic Specification";
? activate BSD PERMANENT FAIL.V4 indication.
***** Maturation Time*****
1s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
