8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
If IPC_OperationalModeSts.Info is equal to "Ignition_On" or to "Ignition_On_Engine_On":
if IPC receives STATUS_UBSS_BH.Ubss_Sts different from "SNA", then IPC shall:
? heal related DTC as detailed in the "IPC Diagnostic Specification";
? deactivate BSD PERMANENT FAIL.V4 indication if it is not required by other diagnosis;
? deactivate recovery as described in IPC Technical Specification.
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
</RECORD>
