<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_OFF;I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO;I_P_OFF
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
In the following "Detect Condition":
Ignition_On
Ignition_Pre_Start
Ignition_Start
Ignition_Crank 
Ignition_On_Engine_On
Ignition_Pre_Off
Ignition_Off,
if "CAN node 30 (HALF)" parameter is equal to "Absent" value, the "IPC" shall:   
not enable the diagnosis of the "missing message" on "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal.

In the following "Detect Condition"
Ignition_On
Ignition_Pre_Start
Ignition_Start
Ignition_Crank 
Ignition_On_Engine_On,
If "CAN node 30 (HALF)" parameter is equal to "Present" value, then "IPC" shall:
enable the plausibility diagnosis of "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal. 

In the following "Detect Condition":
Ignition_On
Ignition_Pre_Start
Ignition_Start
Ignition_Crank 
Ignition_On_Engine_On,
If the plausibility diagnosis of "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal is enable AND "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal is equal to "SNA", then "IPC" shall:
set a "DTC" to "Present" according to "IPC Diagnostic Requirement" document,
set "LDW_DisplaySts.Req" internal signal is equal to "SNA" value,
Actuate the recovery for Indications Management in this functionality according to IPC System Technical Requirement.

In the following "Detect Condition": 
Ignition_On
Ignition_Pre_Start
Ignition_Start
Ignition_Crank 
Ignition_On_Engine_On,
If the plausibility diagnosis of  "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal is enable AND "HAPTIC1.DisplaySts" signal is not equal to "SNA" value, then "IPC" shall:
heal the "DTC", according to "IPC Diagnostic Requirement" document,
performed the requirement defined in "Indication Management" paragraph.
***** Maturation Time*****
&#60;1s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_OFF;I_ON;I_PS;I_ST;I_CR;I_EO;I_P_OFF
