<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT DETECTION CONDITIONS:
Error detected if: 
IF the parameters  Front_Psng_Disable_Switch_Via_Menù is equal to "active" value  AND (Front_Passenger_Bag is not equal to Absent value OR  the parameter Passenger's Knee Bag is equal to  "present" value OR ( Right_Seat_Bag is equal to  "present" value  AND the parameter Driver_side is equal to  "left side" value) OR (the parameter Left_Seat_Bag is equal to "present" value  AND the parameter Driver_side is equal to "right side" value ))
AND 
If the timer T_Lampcheck  is elapsed and AIRBAG1.PsngrBagChargeSts is equal to SNA value or  AIRBAG1.PsngrBagChargeSts is equal to "Not_Present" value,

set Front_Psngr_AirBag_Menu.Req  internal signal to "Disable" value until the error is not present anymore. 
***** Maturation Time*****
&#60;1s
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
