FAULT HEALING CONDITIONS:
Error is healed if: 
IF the parameters  Front_Psng_Disable_Switch_Via_Menù is  NO equal to "active" value  AND (Front_Passenger_Bag is equal to Absent value OR  the parameter Passenger's Knee Bag is NO equal to  "present" value OR ( Right_Seat_Bag is no equal to  "present" value  AND the parameter Driver_side is equal to  "left side" value) OR (the parameter Left_Seat_Bag is no equal to "present" value  AND the parameter Driver_side is no equal to "right side" value ))
AND 
If the timer T_Lampcheck  is elapsed and AIRBAG1.PsngrBagChargeSts is NO equal to SNA value or  AIRBAG1.PsngrBagChargeSts is NO equal to "Not_Present" value,

set Front_Psngr_AirBag_Menu.Req  internal signal to "Disable" value until the error is not present anymore. 
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
