<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Telematic Box Module (TBM) - Missing message</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****

***** Customer Perception Symptom*****

***** Possible Causes*****
a) TBM
b) CAN PINs connected ECC unstable or loosen
c) CAN PINs connected IPC unstable or loosen
d) Short circuit in the CAN bus harness between HCPM and IPC
***** Repair Action*****
a) Verify if TBM is not receiving or sending a signal
b) 3) Restore the correct functionality of the PINs or connectors and their location as well.
c) Restore or, if necessary, replace the harness OR If the fault persists replace the ECU.
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
- IPC TINIT Phase Ended
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT DETECTION CONDITIONS:
Error detected if: 
One or more messages of the node is/are not present on CAN:
STATUS_TBM
NOTE: This diagnosis Inhibits LSMD NODE FAULTY diagnosis.
***** Maturation Time*****
2500 ms
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT HEALING CONDITIONS:
Error is healed if:  
All ETM messages are received
STATUS_TBM
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
</RECORD>
<RECORD id='_00000251D4A8AF10' oid='9A295B1DEA84405fAABC2268E75B96FC' v='14104198'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Entertainment Telematic Module (ETM) - Signal invalid</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****

***** Customer Perception Symptom*****

***** Possible Causes*****
a) ETM
b) CAN PINs connected ECC unstable or loosen
c) CAN PINs connected IPC unstable or loosen
d) Short circuit in the CAN bus harness between HCPM and IPC
***** Repair Action*****
a) Verify if ETM is not receiving or sending a signal
b) 3) Restore the correct functionality of the PINs or connectors and their location as well.
c) Restore or, if necessary, replace the harness OR If the fault persists replace the ECU.
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
- IPC TINIT Phase Ended
- NO IPC DTC Node Absent present
IF [(LTM is PRESENT) OR (ETM is PRESENT)} 
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT DETECTION CONDITIONS:
Error detected if: 
At least one of the messages of the node does have a shorter length than specified:
STATUS_TELEMATIC
TELEMATIC_CLIMATE_SETUP
TELEMATIC_DISPLAY_INFO
TELEMATIC_NAV_INFO
TELEMATIC_TIME_DATE
TELEMATIC_VEHICLE_SETUP3
RADIO_B2
***** Maturation Time*****
2500 ms
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITIONS:
Test executed if: 
8V &#60; VBatt &#60; 16V 
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****
FAULT HEALING CONDITIONS:
Error is healed if:  
All messages are received AND all DLC are corrects
STATUS_TELEMATIC
TELEMATIC_CLIMATE_SETUP
TELEMATIC_DISPLAY_INFO
TELEMATIC_NAV_INFO
TELEMATIC_TIME_DATE
TELEMATIC_VEHICLE_SETUP3
***** De-Maturation Time*****
Immediately
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
</RECORD>
