<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>LIN IPC - Bus Signal/Message Failure</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D2180'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Engineering Notes*****
Circuit short to battery or  Circuit short to ground or bit error
***** Customer Perception Symptom*****

***** Possible Causes*****
Circuit short to battery or  Circuit short to ground or bit error
***** Repair Action*****

</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D0D40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
ENABLE CONDITION:
 There aren't paticular condition to set the fault. 
.
***** Maturation Failure Threshold*****
DETECTION CONDITION:      
The fault is detected during transition key-off-&#62; key-on and in presence of CC to Ground or CC to battery on LIN line.
After a Clear DTC, to dected again the error is necessary a key off -&#62; key on transition
***** Maturation Time*****
0.015
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_00000251D41D1400'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>***** De-Maturation Vehicle Conditions*****
I_ON;I_EO
***** De-Maturation Fault Detection Conditions*****
HEALING CONDITION: 
Next cycle of diagnosis of the LINE with no fail.
***** De-Maturation Failure Threshold*****

***** De-Maturation Time*****
0,005
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
