<DIAGINST id='_00000251D4B5FC60' oid='98488FDCF3004894A0010428B9EC198A' tmplref='_00000251D45A39E0' req='notReq'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Reset Service Information</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Reset Service Information</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC b='1'>see VF269 and IPC_SW_Requirements</FC>
<FC> </FC>
<FC b='1'> for major dettails.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0' struct='1'><PARA><FC b='1'>see VF269 for major dettails.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC b='1'>Reset by Assistance Service:</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>After every service, the technical assistance staff must:</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>reset the counter of the service distance to the starting value through the diagnosis tool. The data have to be readable / rewriteable through diagnosis instruments.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>store the happened realization of the programmed maintenance (coupon). It must therefore remain a trace of the last coupon done, through the indication of: date coupon / n° coupon done / total km covered. The data must be readable / rewriteable through the diagnosis tool. The coupon's number must decrease at every Reset-Info-Service starting from the value of </FC>
<FC tcol='0' b='1' i='1' fs='200'>"ServiceCouponNumber" </FC>
<FC tcol='0' fs='200'>programmed by PROXI.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>In case of instrument cluster replacement, the staff of technical assistance must:</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>restore the km/mi covered present in the total odometer</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>read the number of performed coupons and rewrite them in the new instrument cluster</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>read the counters of the lacking km/mi to the next expiration of programmed maintenance and rewrite them in the new instrument cluster</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>read the date of the last performed coupon and rewrite it in the new instrument cluster</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC></FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>In case of battery detaching (absence of Vbatt) the instrument cluster must guarantee the maintenance of the stored data.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC tcol='0' fs='200'>The visualization of the relative messages must happen as represented in </FC>
<FC tcol='0' i='1' fs='200'>"Documenti di riferimento IPC" - Sezione III - Logiche di visualizzazione su display IPC"</FC>
<FC tcol='0' fs='200'>.</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Reset_Service_Information</QUAL>
<SERVICE id='_00000251D4BC1B70' oid='9F685FED10094ffb8DCFB045E5D02158' tmplref='_00000251D45CCB80' func='0' phys='1' respOnPhys='1' respOnFunc='0' req='0' mayBeExec='(3,5)'>
