<TUV xml:lang='it'>Original VIN Lock</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>This routine initiates the lock of the VIN Original in order to doesn’t allow further updated of VIN Original from VIN Current.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC>The ECU shall lock the ORIGINAL VIN (0xF190).</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' struct='1'><PARA><FC>This routine initiates the lock of the VIN Original in order to doesn’t allow further updated of VIN Original from VIN Current.
The ECU shall lock the ORIGINAL VIN (0xF190).</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
